# ◈ packages.desktop.list — usable live-environment desktop (minus firefox)
#
# CORRECTED from an earlier revision: firefox moved out to its own
# packages.firefox.list / matrix group (since replaced with WebKitGTK/surf
# as packages.browser.list, after firefox's build turned out to hit a
# genuine LLVM compiler bug, not just a time-ceiling issue). A run of the
# firefox group got cancelled at GitHub's hard 6-hour job ceiling with
# firefox still compiling — keeping it isolated meant sway+foot succeed
# and get uploaded
# independently instead of being held hostage by firefox's multi-hour
# build, and firefox gets its own dedicated ccache to resume from run to
# run rather than competing with sway/foot's cache.
#
# sway itself is a full tiling Wayland compositor (gui-wm/sway — Wayland
# compositors live under gui-wm in Gentoo, not gui-apps; corrected from an
# earlier revision) — as opposed to cage's single-app kiosk mode previously
# in packages.graphics.list. foot is included as a minimal terminal
# (gui-apps/foot — also corrected, it's not under x11-terms), since sway
# needs at least one to be useful standalone.

gui-wm/sway
gui-apps/foot
